 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "Back in the 1890s,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.48
  },
  {
   "text": "a builder makes a roller coaster that goes upside down.",
   "s": 1.637,
   "e": 4.409
  },
  {
   "text": "One perfect circle of a loop.",
   "s": 4.941,
   "e": 6.803
  },
  {
   "text": "It costs him everything.",
   "s": 7.238,
   "e": 8.493
  },
  {
   "text": "And of course, his rival copies it,",
   "s": 9.092,
   "e": 10.961
  },
  {
   "text": "bolt for bolt.",
   "s": 11.281,
   "e": 12.013
  },
  {
   "text": "But the night before opening,",
   "s": 12.564,
   "e": 13.753
  },
  {
   "text": "his test dummy comes back crushed.",
   "s": 13.914,
   "e": 15.756
  },
  {
   "text": "Flat as a soda can.",
   "s": 16.041,
   "e": 17.129
  },
  {
   "text": "He can't miss opening day.",
   "s": 17.756,
   "e": 19.231
  },
  {
   "text": "So he grabs a hammer, and bends the bottom of the loop into a long, lazy curve.",
   "s": 19.715,
   "e": 24.213
  },
  {
   "text": "Does he know what he's doing?",
   "s": 24.762,
   "e": 25.728
  },
  {
   "text": "Not really.",
   "s": 26.178,
   "e": 26.734
  },
  {
   "text": "His rival laughs.",
   "s": 27.254,
   "e": 28.367
  },
  {
   "text": "Then sneaks in that night, and cranks the sides together, until the loop is tall and skinny.",
   "s": 28.684,
   "e": 33.323
  },
  {
   "text": "Opening day.",
   "s": 34.007,
   "e": 34.657
  },
  {
   "text": "He climbs into the first cart.",
   "s": 35.142,
   "e": 36.539
  },
  {
   "text": "As it tips over the hill,",
   "s": 36.968,
   "e": 38.167
  },
  {
   "text": "he finally sees the loop.",
   "s": 38.327,
   "e": 39.809
  },
  {
   "text": "Too late.",
   "s": 40.328,
   "e": 40.828
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 41.452,
   "e": 41.809
  },
  {
   "text": "a car can take a hairpin turn at five miles an hour.",
   "s": 41.994,
   "e": 44.78
  },
  {
   "text": "Take it at sixty,",
   "s": 45.169,
   "e": 46.136
  },
  {
   "text": "and it flips.",
   "s": 46.293,
   "e": 47.001
  },
  {
   "text": "A coaster cart is fastest at the bottom of a loop,",
   "s": 47.504,
   "e": 50.068
  },
  {
   "text": "and slowest at the top.",
   "s": 50.291,
   "e": 51.452
  },
  {
   "text": "A perfect circle puts the same sharp turn in both places.",
   "s": 51.991,
   "e": 55.376
  },
  {
   "text": "But his lazy curve at the bottom, and that squeeze at the top?",
   "s": 55.8,
   "e": 58.581
  },
  {
   "text": "Exactly the right shape.",
   "s": 59.075,
   "e": 60.372
  },
  {
   "text": "He sails over without a scratch.",
   "s": 60.886,
   "e": 62.733
  },
  {
   "text": "Across town,",
   "s": 63.194,
   "e": 64.043
  },
  {
   "text": "the rival's cart hits the bottom of his perfect circle.",
   "s": 64.167,
   "e": 66.879
  }
 ]
}